check 1
# Rogue Encampment arrival, idle, the packets channel (specs/tools/packets-trace.md):
# every C->S message the server takes and every S->C message it queues, per frame,
# 1.14d (record_packets.py) against d2rs (state-dump --packets).
# Same start as a1-town-arrival-ama: ScnAma, -seed 1234, no input.
name packets-town-arrival-ama
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 40
seconds 240
channels packets
